Package: viu
Version: 1.6.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: loongarch64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28)
Maintainer: Atanas Yankov <atanas.yankov98@gmail.com>
Description: View images right from the terminal
 viu is a terminal-based image viewer that allows you to view images
 directly from the command line. It supports various image formats
 including PNG, JPEG, GIF, and more.
 .
 Features:
  - Display images in the terminal
  - Support for animated GIFs
  - Resize images on the fly
  - Display image names
  - Support for various output modes (blocks, sixel)
